s Joe(object):\r\n    \"\"\"Class docstring\"\"\"\r\n    counter: int\r\n    \"\"\"Data docstring\"\"\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n### pylint x.py\r\n```\r\n************* Module joe\r\nW:  5, 4: String statement has no effect (pointless-string-statement)\r\n\r\n---------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nYour code has been rated at 6.67/10\r\n```\r\n\r\n### pylint --version output\r\n```\r\nUsing config file .pylintrc\r\npylint 1.8.4, \r\nastroid 1.6.3\r\nPython 3.6.5 (default, Apr 20 2018, 10:13:23) \r\n[GCC 4.2.1 Compatible Apple LLVM 9.1.0 (clang-902.0.39.1)]\r\n```\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/2066/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/2066/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]